[0.090, "o", "t"]
[0.091, "o", "e"]
[0.091, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[5M\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "A featureless, dull black rectangle is embedded in the bricks beside the door. It's about the width\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "of your palm. No fool could doubt the plate has something to do with opening the door, but it\r\u001b[28ddoesn't bear a clue about how to do it.\r\u001b[30d>"]
[2.413, "o", "t"]
